			"notes": "# Seed Atlas v5 — 0.5.0\n\nFor **Minecraft 1.21.11 · Fabric · Java 21+**.\n\n## New since v4\n\n- Faster minimap with cached terrain, progressive updates, travel buffering, cave caching and smoother player tracking.\n- Matching structure icons in the Map Layers menu.\n- Dedicated **Ores** tab; removed the experimental label.\n- Automatic ore updates while travelling or loading chunks, with cached results, limited background work and manual mode.\n- Nearest-biome search at player Y, with waypoint and Show on map actions.\n- World library browser: search saved worlds/servers, copy seeds, rename entries and confirm deletion.\n\nReplace the old JAR and restart; existing settings and saved seeds are retained.\n\nBuild passed; new v5 gameplay remains unverified. Biome searches are sampled and automatic scans have cache limits."
